Fork notice
===========

This is a fork of herdr-osx-menubar (HerdrBar) by bigbug16, adapted to the
herdr-app desktop app (HerdrAppBar). It reads state from `herdr-app ls` and
`hc events` instead of the herdr TUI's socket and plugin hooks.
